flowchart TB
    accTitle: Local CRDT acceptance
    accDescr: Local success follows atomic state and replay persistence plus a covering flush. Failed flush is uncertain and fences writes. Delivery failure does not undo acceptance.
    Call["Validate mutation and reserve slot"]
    Batch["Create operation and apply batch<br/>State, value, position and replay"]
    Flush["Confirm covering storage flush"]
    Success["Return local success<br/>Publish state and try enqueue"]
    Uncertain["Uncertain outcome<br/>Reopen store before new writes"]
    Delivery["Gossip delivery attempt<br/>Bounded queue, bytes and rate"]
    Repair["Durable recovery path<br/>Replay or qualifying baseline"]
    Call --> Batch
    Batch -->|"Batch applied"| Flush
    Flush -->|"Flush confirmed"| Success
    Flush -->|"Flush failed"| Uncertain
    Success --> Delivery
    Delivery -->|"Attempt dropped"| Repair
